      "issues": [
        "The build zone box (X: -3014 to -3008) only covers the west half of the platform. The agent has no in-game indication to build there specifically. It may build near the wool source (east side) or anywhere else on the platform.",
        "Recommend: Either (a) expand the build zone to cover the ENTIRE platform EXCEPT the original wool coordinates, or (b) add a visual marker (gold block, sign) in the build zone to guide the agent, or (c) use a two-part check: first verify original wool is gone (count_in_box at wool location = 0), then check for 8+ purple_wool anywhere on the platform."
      ],
      "recommended_fix": "Use a combined approach: Check that the original wool location has 0 purple_wool blocks (confirming mining), AND check that 8+ purple_wool blocks exist anywhere on the platform. This way the agent can build anywhere."
